== Reward ==
A single piece of one of the following armor sets:

* [[Crazy Cleric Armor]]
* [[Twisted Nature Armor]]
* [[Mischievous Dazzler Armor]]
* [[Sly Summoners Armor]]
* [[Monkey Hide Armor]]
* [[Maleficent Armor]]
* [[Shamanistic Shenannigan Armor]]
* [[Wily Warlock Armor]]

== Walkthrough ==

Talk to [[Bob the Painter]] and give him your [[Words of Wealth]]: you will get an [[Empty Pot of Gold]] (2 slot container).

In that container combine:

* a [[Armor of Distraction]] piece (created via the [[Deck of Spontaneous Generation Quest]])
* a [[:Category:Plane of Mischief Dolls|Plane of Mischief Doll]] (created via the [[The Gift Box]] quest)

to create the corresponding piece of [[Plane of Mischief Armor]] for the class indicated by the [[:Category:Plane of Mischief Dolls|Plane of Mischief Doll]].

